    "id": "3818681173",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Beyond Sight: Whispers of Fate",
    "description": "“Even those who cannot see the future may be bound by it.”\n\nBlind to the world, yet burdened with glimpses of what lies beyond it. While others walk forward guided by what they see, Cassia must navigate a world shaped by visions, forgotten truths, and paths that have yet to unfold.\n\nTo know what may come is not the same as knowing what must be done. Every vision carries its own uncertainty, every choice leaves its mark, and even the smallest decision may set something greater into motion.\n\nFate is a cruel thing when its threads become visible, yet its meaning remains hidden. Some truths arrive too early, others too late, and some may never be understood until the moment has already passed.\n\nPerhaps the greatest burden is not seeing what lies ahead, but knowing that seeing it does not mean having the power to change it.\n\nShadow Slave art\n\nfanart made by Zyro\n\nmusic used River of Time - Griffin Tyler",
